      "scope": "Short Mail already uses the native keyboard and 0xD0 records. A runtime check verifies the actual recipient, buffer cleanup at the shared 0x80147A80 routine, and a reply-flag write only on the matching sequence. The five window constants have their original values. Other modal and wire changes still require review. The broader historical row is still open."
